Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.75,0:01:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say we're cursed\Nchildren because at birth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.15,0:01:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we possess the power to\Ncontrol magical beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You worthless, disgusting rats. I\Nonce heard that a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ago it was an ability that only\Ncontrolled livestock but then
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.41,0:02:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone started using it to\Ncommand monsters in the war and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as a result killed a bunch of\Npeople so we became loathed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to look at\Nme with those dead eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were hit, kicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.93,0:02:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physical abuse became a daily occurrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.83,0:02:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you when you can speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.27,0:02:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I asked a question,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:03:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was beaten until I was\Nalmost unrecognizable,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.09,0:03:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my food rations were taken\Naway for three whole days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.07,0:03:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because of the cursed power, I was able\Nto read the minds of the people around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.37,0:03:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that thing is demon folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.11,0:03:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's the one who killed my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably planning a way to\Nexterminate all us humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should have been that best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when they found out that\NI could read their minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It got even more violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can read minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dreadful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is exactly why they can't be trusted!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting vermin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.93,0:03:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just need to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.17,0:03:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no matter what awful things\Nhappened to me, I never retaliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never even thought of doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.93,0:03:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I hated that\NI was feared, despised,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:04:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and attacked, I never\Ntried to nor wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurt anyone more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.71,0:04:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just didn't want to see any more blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.93,0:04:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have the power to help make a difference\Njust by taking these monsters with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon folk can be useful to\Npeople to the whole nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could bring you more pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.47,0:04:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can be useful to people if you\Nsimply do what I tell you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.61,0:04:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will never be beaten again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you will be fed only the finest foods
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.55,0:04:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and not just you—that\Ngoes for everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you refuse, then\Nyou're right back at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.19,0:04:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless of course things were\Nto get even worse for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The master wore a magical\Ndevice on his forehead,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.51,0:04:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I couldn't read his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.45,0:04:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.95,0:04:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was a man who always kept his word. So.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.39,0:04:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trusted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had never lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.15,0:05:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.63,0:05:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.71,0:05:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't control it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't control it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.77,0:05:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's going to suffer again\Nbecause of me. Because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.77,0:05:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay now it can just\Nkill me I may not have
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,helped anyone but I\Ndidn't hurt anyone either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.61,0:05:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's enough I can die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I'm to be reborn,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.49,0:06:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only hope I won't have to spend\Nthat life with so much suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I can be at least a\Nlittle more useful to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.41,0:06:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I hope I can have something\Ndelicious to eat at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.59,0:06:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life doesn't have to be this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this person protecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.39,0:06:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bleeding stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.69,0:07:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.77,0:07:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I can make this\Nwork out after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, Dad, I'm going to go\Ngather ingredients for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all started a short\Nwhile after I returned
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the training schools\Nin the Royal Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.57,0:08:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was dinner time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.83,0:08:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a whole lot this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.59,0:08:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These will be great to dry out in the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.27,0:08:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then I can pickle these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll stick these in a soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, hey, that's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if there was something\Ndisgusting in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it would just give\Nme a bit of a stomach ache.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was highly poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Low heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.71,0:09:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon's Ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.37,0:09:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom had always told me\Nnever to eat this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I have forgotten that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.25,0:09:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.89,0:09:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Low heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.89,0:09:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.65,0:09:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm still hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.77,0:09:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon's Ruin. I have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.01,0:09:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A poison spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.29,0:09:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.45,0:09:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was also highly poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.91,0:10:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm feeling okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.87,0:10:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eating poison? Maybe I can eat this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.11,0:10:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This actually tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poison is spreading\Nslower than yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gaining some. Tolerance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.61,0:10:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might mean that I'm\Nstarting to get a new ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.46,0:10:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From that moment on, I developed\Na taste for poisonous things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.61,0:10:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On occasion, I collapsed, and in the\Nend, I didn't acquire any skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.19,0:10:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, I could eat poisonous things
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without dying, only some\Nvomiting and a little blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I love it! I can't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.97,0:11:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that poisonous creatures\Nare this delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, who even knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's probably why.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.41,0:11:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't hitting me too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, I couldn't counteract the\Npoison, so I coughed up some blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know from experience,\Nthat much is no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the kid okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My low-heal detox seems\Nto have taken effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.85,0:11:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you take on such a\Nhorrible creature all by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.19,0:11:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.17,0:11:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.53,0:11:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about to give it one last shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.27,0:12:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stench is awful. Dear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.97,0:12:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange that such a huge and dangerous\Nfrog is just outside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.47,0:12:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, well, for me, I bet this big\Nfella is probably pretty tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.63,0:12:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.95,0:12:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, he's not looking too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should probably have\NLin give him a look over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That really was a close one, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you out here all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:12:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who brought that thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, because I promised\Nto bring it to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was bringing it to the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why would he promise to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And promise who?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.41,0:13:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That has to be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.85,0:13:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That frog must be for a giant feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.85,0:13:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're trying to deliver\Nthat much fresh meat,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting it there while still alive\Nis the best way to do it for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.51,0:13:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I understand why he had\Nto use a seal to hide himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.85,0:13:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be safe and not get robbed. Plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure a city that large would have the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.15,0:13:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,techniques to manage\Nsuch a poison properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.91,0:13:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet this kid even\Nput in all the time and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.79,0:13:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,effort to raise this frog from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grow up strong and healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.73,0:13:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good boy, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a good jump in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.69,0:13:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.65,0:13:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ruined the delivery of\Nhis precious livestock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I messed everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.87,0:14:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what this is\Nworth, but I'll pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have much money on me right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.01,0:14:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you know it's going\Nto take me some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.09,0:14:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.61,0:14:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really okay. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.19,0:14:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, no. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's in so many pieces now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how did you even get that\Ncreature this far anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine you could\Nhave dragged it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, um, I can control monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.05,0:14:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how I was able to\Nbring it all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.63,0:14:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you can control them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This tiny kid can really\Nmanipulate something that enormous?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.35,0:14:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid, it's mind-boggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are there other people in the\Nworld who have that skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it not one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.53,0:15:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was born with it, so it's\Njust something I can do. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.73,0:15:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say you were born with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.39,0:15:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you've been able to do that\Nsince you can remember, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impressive, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.45,0:15:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A remarkable gift like that can only be\Nsent down from the gods in the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I, um, you see, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.99,0:15:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm demon folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.67,0:15:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon folk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.69,0:15:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All demon folk can do that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.30,0:15:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I would have to assume that demon folk\Nare a people who all possess that ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.09,0:15:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's nothing really\Nspecial for you. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've imagined so many times about\Nwhat I'd do if I had that skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.49,0:15:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd have animals help\Nwork the fields and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I could use birds, it'd be\Nnice to have them deliver letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.37,0:15:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At night, I wouldn't have to worry\Nabout getting attacked by stray dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.21,0:15:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.17,0:15:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.49,0:16:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, so then you're not\Nafraid of the demon folk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.49,0:16:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't hate me for what I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.87,0:16:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of\Npeople out there who are
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.93,0:16:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,scared of my power and\Nreally hate that I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.73,0:16:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who on earth would hate\Na cool power like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real, I don't think you\Nshould pay much mind to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those fools can say what they want,\Nbut that's a super useful ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.79,0:16:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.97,0:16:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me? Really? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I've been trying\Nto tell you, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.85,0:16:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could take it off your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can someone like me really be\Nneeded and considered helpful?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.57,0:16:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this kid was blessed\Nwith a desirable ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.05,0:17:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so why does he have so little self-worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably has plenty to deal with right\Nnow, but I'm sure he's going places.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.79,0:17:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Telling you, buddy, your\Ntalent is a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People need that way\Nmore than they need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, completely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.29,0:17:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must treat you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.97,0:17:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not even bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.55,0:17:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to brag, but I'm\Nstrong against poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would have to be that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.87,0:17:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't just any poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.15,0:17:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a miasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.45,0:17:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.45,0:17:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an extreme toxin that\Neven ruins the very soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took a direct attack and then\Ncarried on like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.35,0:18:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, there is one possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.29,0:18:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sacred Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Sane the Sovereign\Nof Salvation once showed it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.17,0:18:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to me by honing the body and\Nmind like a reverend saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This technique purifies everything\Nit touches and heals all wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.39,0:18:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the perfection he found at the end\Nof his rather unconventional training.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.07,0:18:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took Instructor Sane 40 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.73,0:18:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Nora has managed to\Nachieve it while still young.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take care of this kid first?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.99,0:18:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.35,0:18:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need help, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pale skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.01,0:18:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hair of silver mixed with light blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.37,0:18:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark eyes that seem like they're\Npulling you into their depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a demon folk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, demon folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.39,0:18:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.61,0:18:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, Instructor, this child,\Num, what are you planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.67,0:19:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can, I want to take\Nhim in the carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.51,0:19:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor, you can't. What? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.95,0:19:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are a dangerous race.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.99,0:19:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most countries immediately\Nexterminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.61,0:19:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really okay with that, Instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.67,0:19:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This child is demon folk, and the\Nmonster it brought caused all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.71,0:19:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is unfortunate that\Nthe weed field got destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.45,0:19:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he can't finish his job with\Nthe poison frog because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.29,0:19:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean the Black Death Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were bringing that to the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.87,0:19:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a child, but he must\Nknow how dangerous that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.95,0:19:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you promised someone to bring\Nthe Black Death Dragon with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who asked you to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.27,0:19:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.23,0:19:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't tell me who it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Concealing the truth will do you no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.47,0:19:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is very important that\Nyou tell us what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.39,0:19:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't know who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just the way it seems to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.87,0:20:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His frightened demeanor and the\Nlook in his eyes, it's clear as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.25,0:20:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This child is a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.29,0:20:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slaves are outlawed\Nwithin the Clay's kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.53,0:20:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that isn't the case in some places.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.03,0:20:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because in all likelihood,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's a child soldier whose status\Nis being taken advantage of.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have a place you call home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I was blindfolded\Npart of the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't even know how to start\Ngoing back to where I came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.73,0:20:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then what do you\Nthink about this idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.45,0:20:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to give him a\Nride to the nearest city.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.13,0:20:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.15,0:20:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father often warned me\Nnot to be misled by rumors
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.57,0:20:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and to trust my own eyes when\Npassing judgment on others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.81,0:20:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But from the moment we met him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.77,0:20:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only saw a boy from a wicked race\Nthat I had always been taught to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see him as a malnourished child\Nwith thin legs and arms and no place to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.07,0:20:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed of myself for\Nbeing so small-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:21:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.41,0:21:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rolo. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.37,0:21:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a great name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.61,0:21:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be easy to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.07,0:21:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ines, I have a favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we take this child?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.35,0:21:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we bring Rolo with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.85,0:21:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel. However...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's no room, he can have my spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.65,0:21:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not the problem, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.27,0:21:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The demon folk are not allowed entry into\NMithra, which is our ultimate destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.31,0:21:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be difficult\Nto bring him with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.87,0:21:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, by the same token, if we\Nwere to leave him on the way there,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.31,0:21:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be difficult\Nfor him to survive alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.43,0:21:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we bring him with us, we may be\Nconsidered enemies of Mithra and attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.61,0:21:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.93,0:21:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.73,0:21:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.64,0:22:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I made a mistake in assuming\Nit would have been long dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.47,0:22:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kevin
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.93,0:22:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The. The.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.45,0:23:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to give a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.09,0:23:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will give a light for my response.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.27,0:23:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will give a light to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.21,0:23:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.83,0:23:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will give a light to the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.85,0:23:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.75,0:23:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.41,0:23:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me love.

